<title>UK: Sal Oppenheim set calls on ProSieben Media PSM.CN.</title>
<headline>Sal Oppenheim set calls on ProSieben Media PSM.CN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sal Oppenheim jr &amp; Cie. Kommanditgesellschaft auf Aktien said it has issued four million call warrants, in four equal tranches on Pro Sieben Media AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	26.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	 DUESSULDORF, FRANKFURT</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	    STRIKE	  ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	    77.0 DEM	12.0 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	    87.0 DEM	9.0 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	    97.0 DEM	6.70 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	    107.0 DEM     5.10 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
